flowchart TD
  A[Artist/lead verified CC0 files and provenance] --> B[Designer/lead exact role mapping]
  B --> C[Final mapping committed before code]
  C --> D[Preloaded cached textures]
  E[Existing authoritative visible markers] --> F[Existing map transform and eligibility]
  F --> G{Approved mapping and state?}
  D --> G
  G -->|yes| H[Draw cached sprite in existing visual bounds]
  G -->|no| I[Existing primitive fallback]
  H --> J[Existing team/status/selection/labels on top]
  I --> J
  K[Existing footprints input and report uncertainty] --> L[Unchanged gameplay/information boundary]
